OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped children jailed for
OL,4,A11 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped two children and
OL,7,Fcommitted a string of other offences
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for 11 years.
OL,10,FWilliam Clay, 20, formerly of Grantham,
OL,11,Fwas sentenced at Lincoln Crown Court,
OL,12,Fsitting at Lincoln Magistrates' Court,
OL,13,Fon Friday.
OL,15,FThe defendant had denied raping one of
OL,16,Fthe victims but was found guilty by a
OL,17,Fjury after a nine-day trial in August.
OL,19,FClay previously admitted three further
OL,20,Frape offences, intentional
OL,21,Fstrangulation and two counts of actual
OL,22,Fbodily harm against a second victim.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
